Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长要你把船保持在五百尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain wants you to keep 500 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部呼叫驾驶舱 升到五百尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maneuvering, Control. Come in shallow to 500 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持五百尺 - 保持五百尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep 500 feet. - Keep 500 feet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急状态 船长请到指挥部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency stations. Captain to the control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 5号舱壁关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Number five bulkhead shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 驾驶舱叫指挥部 - 控制室 我是船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Control, Maneuvering. - Control, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,电频率中断了 我要把系统切断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing electrical frequency. I'll have to break down the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,测量室呼叫指挥部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, Sound Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,声纳设备丧失动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total loss of power on all sonar sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,浮出水面 全速浮出水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surface. Blow forward, blow aft, full ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速浮出水面 开动探测潜望镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full rise on both planes. Raise the search periscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电话接进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, put him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 海军大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, First Sea Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前还没有漫游者号的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been no contact with Ranger yet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不见它 也没收到危难讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sightings, no distress signals, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks very much like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course I will, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们损失了一艘核潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost one of our nuclear submarines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:57.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫斯科）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特金号潜艇神秘失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The submarine Potempkin disappeared without trace?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是大灾难 主席同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a catastrophe, Comrade Chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我会立刻派遣最好的特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course. I'll assign our best agent immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲁贝威区 特工3X在哪？- 在休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rubelvitch, where is Agent XXX? - On leave, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在人民休养康复中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a people's rest and recuperation center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个周未真愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a wonderful weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我永远不会忘记 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I shall never forget it. - Nor will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们何时会再见面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When can we meet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到我的任务完成后即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as my mission is accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是了 我今晚要到达奥地利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must go. I have to be in Austria tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,再躺五分钟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,3X，呼叫3X\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent XXX. Calling Agent XXX.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你马上到总部报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will report to headquarters immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,3X 请答话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent XXX, acknowledge and verify.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是3X 讯息收到 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is XXX. Message received and understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 首相大人 我明白事态的严重性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Prime Minister. I understand the gravity of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会马上调遣最好的特工出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'll put our best man on it at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班儿？007在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, where is 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在奥地利执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on a mission, sir, in Austria.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他立刻撤出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to pull out, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:05:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我找不到语言去形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James, I cannot find the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你找一个适合的词语吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try and enlarge your vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:24.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（007马上向总部报到）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要到哪去？- 对不起 出了事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Sorry, darling. Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, James, I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does England.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚刚离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了 我们在等他 通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Message received. We are waiting. Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:40.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之海底城》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.33,0:10:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫3X进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send in Agent XXX.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军同志 你找我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent for me, Comrade General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 阿玛索娃少校 我们正面对一个棘手的局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Major Amasova, we are facing a most delicate situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的核潜艇完全失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our nuclear submarine Potempkin has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,被破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabotage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就有待你去调查 我们有一个线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is for you to find out. We have one lead:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在开罗有个联络人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A connection in Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有别的事情了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 特工西凯尔波索夫殉职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret to inform you, Major, that Agent Sergei Borzov has been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在奥地利阿雨卑斯山的伯加顿执行任务时遇害\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a mission at Berngarten in the Austrian Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不幸的事件 将军同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tragic occurrence, Comrade General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你跟波索夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had not escaped our notice that you and Agent Borzov…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不只是朋友的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been more than friends for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他时怎样死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,详细情况还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't all the details yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是跟英国的情报组织有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears he'd become involved in a British Secret Service operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如有任何消息 请你通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep me informed, Comrade General.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很希望跟那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should very much like to meet…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.11,0:12:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他杀死的人见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever was responsible for his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, sir. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 007 - 你好 Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, 007. - Hello, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 任务成功吗 - 马马虎虎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mission successful? - On and off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 中校 - 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Commander. - Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 福斯夫上校 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain Forsyth. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是邦德中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Bond, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 国访部长佛雷克葛瑞 - 早安中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Fredrick Gray, Minister of Defense. - Good morning, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:12:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜艇舰队同令哈尔盖里夫上将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Hargreaves, Flag Officer, Submarines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是皇家方舟号吧 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ark Royal, wasn't it? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- M把情况告诉你了吧？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I believe M told you about this. - Yes, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位到这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, please, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:28.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（位置 路线）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是漫游者号预定的巡航范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, I take it, is Ranger's prearranged coastal patrol area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 有多少人知道这条路线？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - How many people knew this course?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔盖里夫上将 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Hargreaves, myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有潜艇的船长泰博特\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Talbot, the submarine captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从什么地方得来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这是目前的高度机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Benson. For the moment, that's top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 这条追踪路线表示…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see, sir. Commander, this tracing means…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联人可以追踪水中的棱子潜艇 并把它击沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Russians can track our nuclear submarines underwater and sink them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我相信他们已经做到了 - 怎么做到的？这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I believe it does. - How could they? It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.80,0:14:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最可能的是热能识别法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heat signature recognition, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以解释吗 - 当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With your permission, Minister? - Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.87,0:14:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,装有红外线热能感应器的卫星…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already know that satellites with infrared heat sensors…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以凭着导弹尾部的火光追踪导弹的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}can detect a nuclear missile in flight by its tail fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人可以探测潜艇的尾波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone can now locate a submerged nuclear submarine…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确定潜艇的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}in exactly the same way, by its wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 他们可以暗中破坏西方的防卫战略\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means they can totally undermine our Western defense strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.43,0:14:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份系统图是从哪里来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did we get that tracing, Freddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从开罗寄来的外交信袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cairo, diplomatic bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想出售追踪系统图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody got the plans of that tracking system and is trying to sell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把路线图送来证明系统是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent us that tracing as proof that it's genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:15:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,若要跟他交易 价钱将会很昂贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, if there is a deal to be made, the price will be high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,高昂？历直是天文数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}"High?" Astronomical.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪了的潜艇装有十六枚导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That missing submarine had 16 Polaris missiles aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在埃及有联络人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a contact in Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,M会把详情告诉你 你今晚出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}M will give you the details. You leave tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴哈曼博士 马柯堆兹教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Bechmann and Professor Markovitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是该跟两位道别的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, now that the moment has come to bid you farewell…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恭喜你们两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I congratulate both you, Doctor, and you, Professor…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭着你们的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}on your brilliant work in the development…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功开发出潜艇追踪系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the submarine tracking system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们的努力下 我很高兴的说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks primarily to you, I'm happy to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动的第一阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the first phase of our operation…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得重大成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}has met with considerable success.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经吩咐助手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have instructed my assistant…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have paid into your…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞士银行户口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swiss bank account…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:16:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,分别存入一千万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sum of $10 million each.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 非常谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, sir. - Thank you, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的合作就到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, I think, concludes our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 在你们离开之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you go, however…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾要告诉你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I very much regret to inform you…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发觉事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a dangerous development…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现了危险的变故\N{\fnArial\fs30}has recently been brought to my notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人尝试把追踪系统计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has been attempting to sell the plans…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,出售给…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our tracking project…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们敌对的强国\N{\fnArial\fs30}to competing world powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人跟这个计划的关系密切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone intimately associated with the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 请你先行离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, it would be more seemly if you left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you who betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你取得了所有的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had access to all the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要接受惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you will pay the penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再次致以衷心的感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, gentlemen, my most profound thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山多尔 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sandor. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大钢牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assigning you the task…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,找回追踪系统的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of recovering the microfilm copy…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,微缩影片拷贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the tracking system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,山多尔 你跟他一起去 服从他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandor, you will go with him. Obey him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有曾经接独过微缩影片的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every person who even comes into contact with that microfilm…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,统统都干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.69,0:19:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机准备起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by for helicopter takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员离开飞行甲板\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel, clear the flight deck platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把二千万元的转帐取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cancel transfer of $20 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.60,0:20:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,知会马柯堆兹教授…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inform next of kin that a tragic accident…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,和巴哈曼博士的亲属\N{\fnArial\fs30}has resulted in the death of Professor Markovitz…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不幸遇难\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dr. Bechmann.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,并已进行海葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The funeral was at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿真主赐福给这个堂皇的住宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the peace of Allah descend upon this magnificent abode…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,并容许我这个孤苦的旅客进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}and allow a poor traveler to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿这个粗劣的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the hospitality of these miserable quarters…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够满足你那尊贵的需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}be sufficient to your honored needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯.邦德 多年不见 很高兴再见到你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond, what a delightful surprise after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请坐 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:22:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在纳闷 你离开剑桥后改究竟在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wondered what you were gonna do when you went down from Cambridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都知道你想要做什么 胡笙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had any problems knowing what you were going to do, Hosein.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是只有石油而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't only have oil, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.87,0:22:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？羊的眼睛？枣子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I offer you? Sheep's eyes? Dates?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.21,0:22:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是伏特加马丁尼？- 情报资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vodka martini? - Information.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.35,0:22:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁要出售潜艇追踪系统？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is putting the submarine tracking system on the market?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在商业上这么有毅力 还真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a pity it is you insist on being so businesslike.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终会跟你交手的那个人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gentleman you will eventually be dealing with…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫马斯卡巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a certain Max Kalba.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.83,0:22:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最终？- 要接触卡巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Eventually?" - To reach Kalba…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟一个叫菲克治的人联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must first make contact with a man called Fekkesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.07,0:22:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他在开罗的地做给你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aziz Fekkesh. I'll give you his apartment address in Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.41,0:22:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天已太晚去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late to meet him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚上愿意留宿在这吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I persuade you to accept a bed for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 不过…我觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of you, Hosein, but I really feel I…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.39,0:23:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不要在这里留宿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you quite sure I can't persuade you to stay the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个人来到埃及时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When one is in Egypt…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.97,0:23:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很应该好好地挖掘当地的宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}one should delve deeply into its treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.85,0:24:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是 对不起 大门是开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Oh, I'm sorry. The door was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.49,0:24:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在电话上跟菲克治先生约好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fekkesh is expecting me. I phoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.36,0:24:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫我带个讯息给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me to give you a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.99,0:24:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他晚一点才有空\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.80,0:24:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吩咐我在你等待时 要好好的招待你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fekkesh asked me to entertain you while you are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.08,0:25:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲克治在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Fekkesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.32,0:25:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的疑心很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.55,0:25:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我这样会活得更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find I live much longer that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.23,0:25:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有任何需要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anything at all you would like…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已生吃过了中饭 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had lunch, but I seem to have missed dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.04,0:25:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我急欲跟他会面 但也不想他突然出现 打扰我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}As urgent as my appointment is, I'd hate him to walk in and surprise us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.71,0:25:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no danger of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会这么快来到吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be some time then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.32,0:25:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有别的约会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he meeting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.53,0:25:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不可以回答你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I cannot answer that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.80,0:25:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.48,0:27:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲克治在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Fekkesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.55,0:27:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,全字塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pyramids.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.42,0:27:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我真是有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a helpful chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上 你来到了全球…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have come tonight to the most fabulous…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.07,0:27:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,最迷人和著名的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and celebrated place in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吉萨高原上 永恒地耸立着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here on the Plateau of Giza stands forever…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.31,0:27:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类最伟大的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mightiest of human achievements.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.81,0:27:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有曾踩踏过这片黄沙的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No traveler, emperor, merchant or poet…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.48,0:27:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅客、帝王、商人和诗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}has trodden on these sands…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.75,0:27:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对之无不肃然起敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not gasped in awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜幕随之升起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The curtain of night is about to rise…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.70,0:28:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞台上即将要上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}and disclose the stage on which…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.87,0:28:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个文明国度的戏剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the drama of a civilization took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.57,0:28:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当中的东西自盘古初开已经存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those involved have been present since the dawn of history…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,顽强地跟风沙对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}pitched stubbornly against sand and wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.15,0:28:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙漠的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the voice of the desert…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.69,0:28:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,连续多个世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}has crossed the centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.27,0:28:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一会 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Major. I'll be back in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.11,0:29:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个黎明 我看着旭日\N{\fnArial\fs30}With each new dawn, I see the sun god rise…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.88,0:29:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在尼罗河岸东升\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the far bank of the Nile.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.03,0:29:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他那忠心的看守人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the faithful warden at the foot of his lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.91,0:30:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既忠心 又有警觉性\N{\fnArial\fs30}So faithful, so vigilant…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.28,0:30:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他非常靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}so near him…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向我显现\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he gave me his face for my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.05,0:30:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是法老的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a pharaoh's companion…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.39,0:30:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是他 法老王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am he, the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是四千五百年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the tomb of Cheops…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.94,0:31:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四王朝的基奥普斯王的陵墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pharaoh of the Fourth Dynasty 4, 500 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.81,0:31:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他建了这座全字塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is the Great Pyramid which he built…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.71,0:31:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护自己 跟死神对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to defend himself against death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在陵墓深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here in the depths of his tomb…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.74,0:31:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝的仆人正等待着被召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}a servant of the king awaits the call…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.68,0:31:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,以展开迈向永恒之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}to set out upon his journey into eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.68,0:31:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神在等待看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death lies waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.33,0:31:59.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马斯卡巴 穆杰巴俱乐部 晚上九时四十分）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.11,0:32:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲克治在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Fekkesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟法老在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the pharaohs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.85,0:32:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你杀了他 - 不 我发现他时 他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You killed him. - No, he was dead when I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.71,0:32:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢这场秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you enjoyed the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.18,0:32:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.22,0:33:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是喜出望外 欢迎来到穆杰巴俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an unexpected pleasure. Welcome to the Mujaba Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.99,0:33:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喝一杯吗？阿玛索娃少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy you a drink, Major Amasova?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.72,0:33:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我该称呼你做3X？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or may I call you XXX?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.79,0:33:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.66,0:33:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让人留下深刻印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made quite an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.86,0:33:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替我的手下道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about Ivan and Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.43,0:33:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做得过火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They exceeded their orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.30,0:33:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好员工难求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good staff is hard to find these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.01,0:33:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给这位小姐一杯巴卡第加冰块\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lady will have a Bacardi on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.54,0:33:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位先生要伏特加马丁尼 要摇而不要搅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the gentleman, vodka martini, shaken not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.28,0:34:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touche.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.15,0:34:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯.邦德海军中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.22,0:34:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,被选中加入了英国情报组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recruited to the British Secret Service from the Royal Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.79,0:34:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以合法杀人 杀人无数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licensed to kill, and has done so on numerous occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.36,0:34:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有无数女朋友 曾结过一次婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many lady friends, but married only once.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.20,0:34:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妻子被杀… - 好了 我知道你很了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wife killed… - All right, you've made your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.37,0:34:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.94,0:34:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对某些事确很敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}About certain things, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.71,0:34:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,请恕我失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可惜 我已经有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragically, I have a previous engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.98,0:34:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happily enough, so do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.28,0:34:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告辞了 邦德先生 - 应该说再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good-bye, Mr. Bond. - Let's say au revoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个很奇怪的预感 我们会再见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the oddest feeling we'll be meeting again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.06,0:34:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找卡巴先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Mr. Kalba.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.56,0:34:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡巴先生是这个俱乐部的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Max Kalba is the owner of the club, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.37,0:34:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.62,0:35:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡巴先生？我叫詹姆斯 邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kalba, my name is James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.73,0:35:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.70,0:35:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟菲克治先生有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had an appointment with Mr. Fekkesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.76,0:35:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又如何？- 他不能来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well? - He won't be joining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.51,0:35:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一些我想买的东西 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something I'm interested in buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.55,0:35:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对那东西也有兴趣竞投\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a moment. I would like to bid for it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.45,0:35:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了拿饮品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot your drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.26,0:35:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你有对手了 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems you have competition, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.46,0:35:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From where I sit…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:36:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看得出来她的身段一流\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fancy you will find the lady's figure hard to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.80,0:36:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,号争者可以看看那件东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might the contestants be permitted to view the article for sale?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.98,0:36:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要先喊价？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, who will start the bidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.32,0:36:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡巴先生 有电话找你 是紧急电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kalba, sir, the telephone. An urgent call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.76,0:36:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.67,0:36:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,借光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.61,0:36:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卡巴 请问是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Kalba. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.75,0:37:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要再来一杯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.26,0:37:56.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（暂停使用）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.49,0:38:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再用这种方式见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've really got to stop meeting like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.27,0:38:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡巴去接电话了 他怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kalba was called to the phone. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.87,0:38:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被打断…永久地打断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was cut off, permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.21,0:38:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那卷微缩影片呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the microfilm?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.04,0:38:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以搜身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是给他拿走了 否则你不会在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have it, or you wouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.28,0:38:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道他的来历\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.78,0:39:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是职业杀手 - 外号大钢牙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a professional killer. - Called Jaws?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.95,0:39:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make no mistake, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.32,0:39:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那卷微缩影片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that microfilm…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.66,0:39:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是要定的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm going to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.83,0:39:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是我先得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I get it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.99,0:42:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.90,0:42:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.18,0:42:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,微缩影片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the microfilm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.29,0:43:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃及的建筑商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Egyptian builders.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.56,0:44:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你迟了一步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. You're just too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.30,0:44:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.40,0:44:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.14,0:44:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,试用大钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.22,0:44:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以弹别的音调吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you play any other tune?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.16,0:44:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们试倒裆 就是向后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try reverse. That's backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.31,0:45:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来开车好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like me to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.29,0:45:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.79,0:45:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.06,0:45:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是摇而不是搅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaken, but not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.63,0:45:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是铆工 替这头大猩猩镶的牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gorilla must have his teeth fixed by a riveter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.33,0:45:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你刚才弃我而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, thanks for deserting me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.50,0:45:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人都得为自己打算 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every woman for herself. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.40,0:46:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你依然救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, you did save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.01,0:46:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣人都会犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all make mistakes, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.45,0:46:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,气缸盖的密封垫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cylinder head gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.79,0:47:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.30,0:47:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我们穿得过分隆重了 不过他会送我们去开罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks we're overdressed, but he'll take us to Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.27,0:47:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.03,0:48:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越冷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.76,0:48:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么做才能使你暖一点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything I can do to warm you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.63,0:48:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.90,0:48:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在西伯利亚曾经上过求生课程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went on a survival course in Siberia.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.40,0:48:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你们很多同胞也修过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I believe a great number of your countrymen do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.41,0:48:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们教你什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.94,0:49:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有积极的斗志是非常重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it's very important to have a positive mental attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.58,0:49:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有更实际一点的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more practical than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.15,0:49:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物也是非常重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food is also very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.09,0:49:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在有需要的时候互相取暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}When necessary, shared bodily warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the part I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.37,0:49:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在西伯利亚真的是这么做的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this really what they do in Siberia?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.54,0:49:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 不过做法不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but not how they do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.89,0:49:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想占我的便宜 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not trying to take advantage of me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.43,0:49:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没这样想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought never crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.17,0:50:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当事情越来越有意思的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when it was getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.31,0:50:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.05,0:51:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 钱班儿 - 早安 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, Moneypenny. - Good morning, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.95,0:51:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he in?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.16,0:51:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是个很热闹派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have been quite a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.53,0:51:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,闷死人 钱班儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.16,0:52:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.55,0:52:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我们正在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, James. We've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.72,0:52:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.22,0:52:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a change in plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.69,0:52:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许已经认出了他是国安会的戈高尔将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably recognize my opposite number in the KGB, General Gogol.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.23,0:52:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你跟阿玛索娃少校很熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you're familiar with Major Amasova.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.23,0:52:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知道她抽哪个品牌的香烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to know which brand of cigarette she smokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.47,0:52:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对方政府都同意投资资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our respective governments…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.17,0:52:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,以协助我们找出潜艇的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}agreed to pool their resources to find out what happened to our submarines.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.24,0:52:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们踏入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have entered a new era…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.31,0:52:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,英苏合作的新纪元\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Anglo-Soviet cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.48,0:52:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了显示饿国的诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a sign of Russian good faith…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.95,0:52:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备交出由3X找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm prepared to make available to you the microfilm…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.98,0:52:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,微缩影片\N{\fnArial\fs30}recovered by Agent XXX.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.52,0:52:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说是不费吹灰之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}With considerable ease, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.62,0:53:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别费心了 这东西一点用都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother. It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.79,0:53:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在船上检查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I examined it on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.03,0:53:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以保证它是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you it is quite genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.33,0:53:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是最重要的技术资料已经被拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that the vital technical information has been taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.53,0:53:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西只是用来吊我们的胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was only intended to whet our appetites.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.88,0:53:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许Q会有所发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Q can make something out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.33,0:53:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要那在在茶会前准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that ready for Akmid's tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.27,0:53:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先走\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you, Alexis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.93,0:53:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你先走 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After you, Miles. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.96,0:54:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可使你掉眼泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could bring tears to your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.47,0:54:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家准备好了没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody ready? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.17,0:54:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确定这些图像是在意大利起草的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pretty certain that this drawing was drafted in Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.64,0:54:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,纸张是威尼斯制的八开纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The size corresponds with a Venetian octavo…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.61,0:54:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,字样是意大利文\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the typeface is an Italian one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.11,0:54:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,截线上有一条轻微的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, note the slight upward stress on the transversals.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.48,0:54:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that mark there?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.95,0:54:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该放在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably a show-through of something…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.29,0:54:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,草图下面的纸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}the drawing was resting on when it was photographed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.46,0:54:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是匆忙拍下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been done in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.49,0:54:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以把它放大吗？- 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you enlarge it? - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.47,0:54:53.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小礼拜堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.47,0:54:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「小礼拜堂」是什么意思？- 即是礼拜堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Oratory?" What is that? - It's another word for chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.67,0:55:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来像是主教的冠冕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks a bit like a bishop's mitre.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.17,0:55:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一条鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.04,0:55:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是斯特龙伯格航运的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the symbol of the Stromberg Shipping Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.91,0:55:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界超级富豪之一的卡尔斯特龙伯格？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karl Stromberg? He's one of the richest men in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.88,0:55:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是西方主要的资本主义剥削者之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the principle capitalist exploiters of the West, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.39,0:55:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是「礼拜堂」而是「实验室」\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's not "oratory, " it's laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.55,0:55:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特龙伯格拥有海洋研究实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stromberg has a marine research laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.36,0:55:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是在科西嘉\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Corsica, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.96,0:55:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.26,0:55:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实那是在萨丁尼亚岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it is in Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.00,0:55:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.91,0:55:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这两位能干的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certain that two such perceptive talents…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.84,0:55:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会喜欢一起到萨丁尼亚岛工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}will enjoy working together in Sardinia…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.11,0:55:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,实践英苏合作的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that it will help to make Anglo-Soviet cooperation a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.60,0:56:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.10,0:56:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐非常美味 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a delicious meal. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.84,0:56:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道原来你的胃口是这么大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize you had such a healthy appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.28,0:56:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.94,0:56:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是搭火车的关系吧 我很喜欢搭火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be traveling by train. I always enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.18,0:56:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得有一次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember when…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.82,0:56:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记起了什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.49,0:56:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎要谈到一趟任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to talk about a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.62,0:56:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可笑吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silly, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.46,0:56:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是同行 却不能交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't talk, and yet we're in the same business.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.66,0:56:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且还处于敌对的阵营 - 现在我们并不是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But with rival companies. - We're not rivals at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.60,0:56:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有兴趣在睡前跟我喝一杯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how about a nightcap, on the company?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.94,0:56:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My company.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.44,0:56:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我有预感明天将会很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry. I have an idea tomorrow is going to be a busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.64,0:56:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须要睡觉 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I must sleep. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.25,0:56:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 好好睡 - 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then, sleep well. - And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.32,0:56:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.46,0:59:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.72,0:59:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走进来要吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just dropped in for a quick bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.90,0:59:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.23,0:59:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会再处理它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.90,0:59:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.57,1:00:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在求生训练上如何教你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it they taught you on that survival course?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.24,1:00:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有积极的斗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}A positive mental attitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.08,1:00:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相取暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And shared bodily warmth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.92,1:00:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没说过要怎么避风吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about keeping out of drafts?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.60,1:00:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然喜欢搭火车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still enjoy traveling by train?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.11,1:00:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.75,1:00:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.79,1:00:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不先躺下让我看看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you lie down and let me look at it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.75,1:01:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,绷带要怎么用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can we use for a bandage?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.25,1:01:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.06,1:01:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.75,1:02:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 少校 - 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Major Boothroyd. - Good morning, Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.92,1:02:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看Q带了什么给我们 很不错吧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what Q has brought for us. Isn't it nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.43,1:02:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留踪听好 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Now pay attention, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.43,1:02:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小踪使用它 它有特殊装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take great care of this equipment. There are some special accessories…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.67,1:02:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有试过让你失望吗了 - 经常都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have I ever let you down? - Frequently.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.57,1:03:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们预订了房间的 我们姓斯特林\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a reservation for me. The name is Sterling.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.01,1:03:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 斯特林伉俪 在开罗预订的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Mr. And Mrs. Sterling. Booked from Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.78,1:03:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.28,1:03:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们预留了A5套房 里面包括客厅 和两间卧房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have Suite A-5 for you; a sitting room and two bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.05,1:03:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班儿真是过分有效率了 我有留言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny being over-efficient. Do you have any messages for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.93,1:03:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.43,1:03:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 他愿意正式接见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent. We have been granted an audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.46,1:04:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯特林先生 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Sterling? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.13,1:04:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫娜欧蜜 斯特龙伯格先生派我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Naomi. Mr. Stromberg sent me to collect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.14,1:04:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？她是内子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do? This is my wife…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.54,1:04:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我的助年\N{\fnArial\fs30}who also happens to be my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.87,1:04:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是来度假的吗 - 只要是有海洋的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are on holiday here? - Where there's an ocean…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.81,1:04:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋生物学家就无法休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}a marine biologist is never on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.51,1:04:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以先请你喝一杯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we offer you a drink before we go?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.82,1:04:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢了 斯特龙伯格先生是非常忙碌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you. Mr. Stromberg's a very busy man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.82,1:04:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的时间很宝贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}His time is precious.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.82,1:04:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮的造物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a handsome craft.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.56,1:04:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,线条一流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such lovely lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.49,1:05:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.99,1:05:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是令人钦佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.63,1:05:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟斯特龙伯格先生见面时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if you'd mind showing my wife around…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.63,1:05:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以带我妻子游览一下吗？- 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- while I'm with Mr. Stromberg. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.10,1:05:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还边走 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.93,1:05:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别替娜欧蜜添麻烦 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a bother to Naomi, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.67,1:05:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我为上回来 - 还有一件事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be back soon. - By the way…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.01,1:05:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生不太喜欢握年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stromberg prefers not to shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.11,1:06:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请按第三个按钮 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the third button. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.04,1:06:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地球还有恕成的地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we seek to conquer space…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.05,1:06:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有待发掘时 为何还要征服太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}when seven-tenths of our universe remains to be explored?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.65,1:06:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,海底世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world beneath the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.65,1:06:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看来已经准备就绪 要修正还个错处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to be well-equipped to repair that oversight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.59,1:06:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫劳勃斯特林 非常感谢你接见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Robert Sterling. It's very kind of you to receive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.47,1:06:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意跟志同道合的人见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always a pleasure to welcome someone with a mutual interest.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.77,1:07:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还里有数目繁多的珍贵品种\N{\fnArial\fs30}An extraordinary number of rare species.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.28,1:07:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然可以分辨那是什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recognize that variety, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.82,1:07:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.73,1:07:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有翅飞鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other fish avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.93,1:07:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他鱼类对他都敬而远之 背上的刺充满毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those dorsal spines are laden with venom.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.23,1:07:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮 却是从以致命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handsome, but deadly.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.80,1:07:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然是这方面的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you know your subject.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.47,1:07:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功在于尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}One tries.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.48,1:07:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家非常华丽壮观\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a remarkable establishment here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.65,1:07:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢遁世\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm somewhat of a recluse.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.82,1:07:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望可以用我喜欢的形式生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to conduct my life on my own terms…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.59,1:07:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在我认同的环境里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in surroundings with which I can identify.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.59,1:07:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是有钱人的特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a privilege of wealth.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.43,1:07:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不怀念外面的世界吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you miss the outside world?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.76,1:08:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 还里就是全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, this is all the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.10,1:08:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有美好的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's beauty…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.44,1:08:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有丑陋的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's ugliness…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.78,1:08:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there is death.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.28,1:08:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会对这个很感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you will find this interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.49,1:08:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,海底城\N{\fnArial\fs30}An underwater city.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.29,1:08:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很迷人 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.46,1:08:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人类未来的唯一希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only hope for the future of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.79,1:08:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都有梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.29,1:08:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是梦想 斯特林先生很快就会成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}No dream, Mr. Sterling. Soon a reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.90,1:08:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请恕我失陪 我还要处理事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you must excuse me. I have business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.97,1:08:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 斯特林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.47,1:08:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我们不会再见 我祝福你的研究顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't meet again, I wish you luck with your research.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.08,1:08:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 今天的惊鸿一瞥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. The brief glimpse you've afforded me today…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.91,1:08:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会激励我更用踪研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}will only encourage me to redouble my efforts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.58,1:08:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.94,1:09:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真有趣 - 你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How interesting. - There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.77,1:09:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得看看这个模型 真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, you should look at this model. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.44,1:09:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是本公司船队的最新成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Liparus…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.11,1:09:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,利帕鲁斯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}the latest addition to the Stromberg fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.51,1:09:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,九个月前才下水的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launched nine months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.45,1:09:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它重逾一百万吨 是世上最大的油轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}At over a million tons, it's the largest tanker in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.49,1:09:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是比不上马克斯号 - 真的吗了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After the Karl Marx, of course. - Really, darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.46,1:09:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的见识真是广博\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing the items of information you store away.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.80,1:09:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是火车上的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were they the two on the train?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.24,1:09:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯.邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.91,1:09:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,女的是俄国特工阿玛索娃少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the woman is Major Amasova, a Russian agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.41,1:09:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们走到岸边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them get ashore…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.92,1:09:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把他们干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.60,1:10:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么神秘亏亏的？我们要到哪去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being very secretive. Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.60,1:10:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再看一下那个实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want another look at that Stromberg laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.44,1:10:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以从那儿操纵追踪系统吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you could operate the tracking system from there?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.54,1:10:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.11,1:10:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只知道那两艘核潜艇失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we know for sure is that two nuclear submarines are missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.13,1:10:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那艘油轮的模型怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you think of that tanker model?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.30,1:10:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,船头的设计有点古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something strange about the design of her bows.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.40,1:10:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已要求M去调查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've asked M to check her out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.78,1:11:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 那辆机车… - 已经跟踪了我们一英里多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James, that motorcycle… - Has been following us for a mile.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.07,1:12:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然它有羽饰 始终不能飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those feathers and he still can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.75,1:12:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.19,1:13:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾否感觉过有人不喜欢你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever get the feeling somebody doesn't like you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.54,1:14:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会游泳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you swim?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.81,1:15:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是该向不速之客道别的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time we said good-bye to an uninvited guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.60,1:15:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于没有人骚扰我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.64,1:16:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是要看还个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we've come to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.38,1:17:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.56,1:17:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.90,1:18:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.67,1:18:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年前 我偷了这辆车子的蓝图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole the blueprints of this car two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.58,1:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会没事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we can make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.92,1:20:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.92,1:20:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有个留言要给你 - 你刚刚已经传送过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a message for you. - I think you just delivered it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.42,1:20:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.37,1:20:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt you…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.94,1:20:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要M替我调查…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I asked M for a list of all the ports…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.11,1:20:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那艘油轮停泊的港口\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Stromberg tanker had called at.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.45,1:20:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the answer?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.12,1:20:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自建成以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the nine months since she was fitted out…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.12,1:20:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没停泊的记绿\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no record of her having put into port anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.46,1:20:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是真的话 那就很奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very odd, if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.96,1:20:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这方面 我们不会弄错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't make mistakes of that sort.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.73,1:20:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的口气很像俄国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound just like a Russian.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.73,1:20:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该仔细检查那艘油轮 你觉得呢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should take a closer look at that tanker, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.74,1:20:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.24,1:21:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该联络戈高尔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I contact Gogol?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.08,1:21:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这个需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.41,1:21:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- M已经通知了他 - 很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- M has already offered to fix it. - Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.32,1:21:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在奥地利伯加顿买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Austrian. I bought it in Berngarten.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.09,1:21:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当时我在滑雪 - 什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was doing some skiing. - When was this?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.69,1:21:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概三个星期 干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About three weeks ago. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.27,1:21:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.48,1:21:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.78,1:21:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man I loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.28,1:21:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,三周前他在伯加顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in Berngarten three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.09,1:21:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否杀了他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.23,1:21:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当有人要在你身后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When someone's behind you on skis at 40 miles an hour…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.57,1:22:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,边杀你的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to put a bullet in your back…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.24,1:22:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有时间去记住他的客貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't always have time to remember a face.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.24,1:22:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们这行 总会有人被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}In our business, people get killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.75,1:22:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道 他也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know that. So did he.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.58,1:22:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他死 便是我亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was either him or me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.45,1:22:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题的答案是：是的 我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer to the question is yes. I did kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.93,1:22:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 当任务完成之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, when this mission is over…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.73,1:22:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.56,1:22:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.40,1:23:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡特司令官？- 我就是 欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Commander Carter? - That's right. Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.73,1:23:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校 请坐 你要喝点什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major. Have a seat. Can I get you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.57,1:23:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢了 不知道少校要不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for me, thank you. I don't know about the major.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.08,1:23:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我没想到你是女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I hadn't expected you to be a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.78,1:23:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是俄军的阿玛索娃少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aboard this vessel, Commander, I am Major Amasova of the Russian Army.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.29,1:23:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 谢谢你出手相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, sure. - It's good of you to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.66,1:23:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经为你们准备了两个客舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a couple cabins at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.73,1:23:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.26,1:23:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校 欢迎你使用我的浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major, you're most welcome to use the shower in my quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.53,1:23:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用特别优待我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not have to show me any special favors, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.70,1:23:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只觉得这样做比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the same, I think it might be better if I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.11,1:23:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是太平洋的潜艇传过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Com Sub Atlantic, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.58,1:23:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.52,1:24:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, sailor?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.69,1:24:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过少校洗澡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never see a major taking a shower before?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.26,1:24:20.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（尼帕鲁斯号）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.18,1:24:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备再次观察目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by for second observation on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.12,1:24:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动潜望镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up scope.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.19,1:24:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.06,1:24:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标方向及距离已记下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target bearing. Mark. Range. Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.27,1:24:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下潜望镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down scope.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.40,1:24:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个师团 - 距离六千二百码\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One division in high power. - Range 6, 200 yards, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.14,1:24:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,船头的角度五十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angle on the bow, port 50.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.14,1:24:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制室、鱼雷室 登艇部队已准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, Torpedo Room. Boarding party ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.05,1:25:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 最佳的方法是120时速三海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, sir, our best solution for the target is 120. Speed three knots.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.05,1:25:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲板 向北面转 驾驶舱 加速至11海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer of the deck, come right north. Maneuvering, make turns for 11 knots.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.52,1:25:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲板船员收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer of the deck, aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.09,1:25:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪颗子弹有我的名字？第一颗还是最后一颗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which bullet has my name on it? The first or the last?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.43,1:25:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没失败试过任何任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never failed on a mission, Commander. Any mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.37,1:25:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case, Major…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.87,1:25:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间必然有一方会很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of us is bound to end up gravely disappointed…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.01,1:25:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}because neither of the…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.48,1:25:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部 电频率中断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, Maneuvering. We're losing electrical frequency.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.48,1:25:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,声纳室叫指挥部 电力中斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, Sonar. Total power supplies failure on all sets.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.29,1:25:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,浮出水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surface! Blow forward! Blow aft!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.94,1:25:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备潜望镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up scope. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.88,1:26:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.05,1:26:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.46,1:26:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.39,1:27:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号船坞准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by on number two dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.53,1:27:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼帕鲁斯号船员们 各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liparus crew, take up positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.23,1:27:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,船坞船员到操作室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dock Officer to Operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.97,1:27:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,调动组组员进入船坞范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mobilization crew entering dock area.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.14,1:27:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号船坞呼叫操作室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number two dock to Operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.08,1:27:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有二十五米 我重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-five meters to run. I say again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.89,1:27:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,操作室呼叫二号船坞 船只已进入船坞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Room to number two dock. Docking now complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.42,1:28:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,登陆船员各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disembarkation crew moving into position.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.94,1:28:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,S射线程序完成 磁场关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}S Ray program completed. Magnetic field shut down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.94,1:28:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All systems normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.18,1:28:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,扬声器已准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Limpet speaker in position, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.71,1:28:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令官 你有两分钟的时间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander, you have precisely two minutes…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.65,1:28:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开舱口 弃船投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}to open your hatches and surrender your ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.95,1:28:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你们会被…氰毒气处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alternative is extermination by cyanide gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.63,1:28:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.00,1:28:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no alternative.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.64,1:28:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听好船长的说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hear this. Your Captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.80,1:28:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有舱口打开 肃静的离开船只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open all hatches and proceed quietly onto the casing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.62,1:29:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快 我没什么耐性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Commander. I'm not renown for my patience.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.39,1:29:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,列成两队 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, two ranks. Move it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.86,1:29:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧紧跟着我 我们会尽量掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close to me. We'll try and hide you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.03,1:29:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our time is limited, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.07,1:29:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上开始行动 - 遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Commence operations forthwith. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.27,1:29:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention all personnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.81,1:29:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特龙伯格第一及第二队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stromberg crews One and Two…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.41,1:29:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要登上你们的潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}embark your submarines.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.43,1:29:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些美国人跟其他人关在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the Americans in with the others, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.80,1:29:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把俘虏带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.31,1:29:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抬头望 有人在偷拍我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look up. You're on Candid Camera.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.75,1:30:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经装上核导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complete nuclear missile loading.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.12,1:30:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达室呼叫操作室 方圆二万五千米以内没有联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operations, Radar. No contacts within 25, 000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.42,1:30:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那两名俘虏带进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring those two prisoners here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.21,1:31:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.85,1:31:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,声纳室叫操作室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operations Room, Sonar.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.68,1:31:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准联络和发送\N{\fnArial\fs30}No contacts, no transmissions.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.65,1:31:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止稳定装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease stable hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.39,1:31:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真是锲而不舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have certainly been persistent.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.99,1:31:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我可以满足你们的好奇心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. Now your curiosity can be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.50,1:31:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,两组的人员已经登船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both crews aboard, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.27,1:31:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,核导弹已经装置完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile onload completed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.00,1:31:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经知道了自己的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have already been given their targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.81,1:31:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在十二点整低达开火的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 12:00 noon, they will have reached firing positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.48,1:31:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约和莫斯科…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within minutes, New York and Moscow…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.95,1:31:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}will cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.95,1:31:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着世界将会瓦解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Global destruction will follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.95,1:31:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的纪元即将开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new era will begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.62,1:31:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号及二号潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Submarines One and Two…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.56,1:31:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始出发程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}commence departure drill.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.69,1:31:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我知道你是来真的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you've made your point.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.76,1:32:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.37,1:32:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How much?"
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.87,1:32:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟你指的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever do you mean, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.97,1:32:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不发射核导弹的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price for not firing those nuclear missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.51,1:32:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're deluded, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.24,1:32:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是要敲诈勒索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested in extortion.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.05,1:32:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是要改变历史的面貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to change the face of history.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.65,1:32:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要毁灭世界？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By destroying the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.49,1:32:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是创造世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}By creating a world.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.19,1:32:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在海洋里的美丽新世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new and beautiful world beneath the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.36,1:32:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的人类文明既腐败又堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, civilization as we know it is corrupt and decadent.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.83,1:32:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,终有一天会自取灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inevitably, it will destroy itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.56,1:32:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是加速这件事的发生而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm merely accelerating the process.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.57,1:32:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还并不能为大屠杀辩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does not justify mass murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.61,1:32:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对与错\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that, Major…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.77,1:32:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会留待后世去评价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will accept the judgment of posterity.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.94,1:32:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜艇可以出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Submarines ready for departure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.68,1:32:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开船头的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open bow doors, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.42,1:32:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特龙伯格一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stromberg One…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.42,1:33:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are clear to proceed to sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.03,1:33:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特龙伯格二号 你也可以出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stromberg Two, you are also clear to proceed to sea. Forward stern.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.01,1:33:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看清楚用来毁灭世界的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Observe, Mr. Bond, the instruments of Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.58,1:33:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个人跟其他俘虏一并关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put this man with the rest of the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.98,1:34:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还位小姐会跟我一起到亚特兰蒂斯去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lady will be traveling to Atlantis with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.70,1:34:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别了 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.70,1:34:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 这个词语…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That word has, I must admit…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.00,1:34:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次意味着永恒的离别\N{\fnArial\fs30}a welcome ring of permanency about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.01,1:34:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 安雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Au revoir, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.88,1:34:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.82,1:35:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that man!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.03,1:35:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.71,1:35:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫他过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call him over.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.50,1:35:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长在哪？- 我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your captain? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.30,1:35:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找其他人 然后到军械库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release the other crews, then make for the armory.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.17,1:35:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me, men. At the double.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.98,1:36:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.92,1:36:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把操作室密封起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal the operations room!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.37,1:36:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到那里准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Stand by over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.81,1:36:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help yourself to firearms!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.32,1:36:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿武器 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a weapon. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.94,1:38:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已占领了船坞范围 但你们的船长已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've taken both sides of the lower dock area, but your captain's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.44,1:38:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是无法走近控制室\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still no closer to that control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.08,1:38:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.62,1:39:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁 詹姆斯 马歇尔 帕维斯跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrews, James, Marchal, Purvis. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.75,1:39:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些铜板一定有几寸厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That armored plating must be inches thick.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.39,1:39:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们无法把它射穿的 - 到军械库去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll never get through it. - Let's get to the armory.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.69,1:39:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要到那里找什么 - 核导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you reckon to find there? - A nuclear missile.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.92,1:39:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nuc… Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.64,1:39:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这需要很长时间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could take hours, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.81,1:39:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有约会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a date?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.88,1:39:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.88,1:40:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.98,1:40:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你觉得很辛苦 很对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry if you feel less than comfortable…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.39,1:40:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你有暴力倾向 我得把它控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have a tendency to violence that must be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.50,1:40:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 我得报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - I have to report, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.00,1:40:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些犯人逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a breakout by some of the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.47,1:40:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是令人遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is unfortunate, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.50,1:40:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 情况已经受到控制了\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, sir, we now have the situation under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.67,1:40:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们无法把控制室攻破\N{\fnArial\fs30}The operations room is quite impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.88,1:40:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们不要再发生不幸的事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we must hope, Captain, that you will suffer no further mishap.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.06,1:40:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把雷管取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need out of here is the detonator.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.05,1:41:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的知道自己在干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, are you sure you know what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.98,1:41:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事总有第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be a first time for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.93,1:41:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.76,1:41:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.77,1:41:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能碰到脉动导体电路的任何一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mustn't touch any part of the impulse conductor circuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.67,1:41:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉动导体电路就储藏在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ring houses the impulse conductor circuit, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.31,1:41:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是有磁性的 雷管万万不能碰到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's magnetic. I mustn't touch it with any part of the detonator.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.14,1:41:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 若碰到了会怎么样？- 它会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happens if you do? - It'll go off.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.12,1:42:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要六号雷管 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me a number six detonator. - Aye, aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.19,1:42:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 六号 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Number six, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.33,1:42:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否准备了二十秒的导火线吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you fix that 20-second fuse?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.43,1:42:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.20,1:42:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,塑胶炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plastic explosive.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.45,1:42:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切顺利吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything proceeding according to plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.49,1:42:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 顺利 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.04,1:44:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官？- 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.78,1:44:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,画面消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monitors faded.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.80,1:44:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变电路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change the circuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.04,1:45:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.51,1:45:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.94,1:45:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜艇已经到达指定位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our submarines are already on station.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.04,1:45:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹将会于四分钟之后发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}In four minutes, the missiles will be launched.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.62,1:45:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会操作电报装置吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you work the printout transmission unit?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.82,1:45:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,会 但是我们只剩下三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, but we've only got three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.92,1:45:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们找出潜艇的位置 就可以把程序改编\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can work out the position of those submarines, maybe we can reprogram them.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.10,1:45:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干什么？- 让他们自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To do what? - To destroy each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.38,1:46:20.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（位置及移动方向）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.10,1:46:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！那圆球\N{\fnArial\fs30}James! The globe!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.54,1:46:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一号潜艇的位置列为二号潜艇的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass the position of the first submarine to the second as their target.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.61,1:46:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反之亦然 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And vice versa? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.00,1:47:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹控制室 我是船长 目标有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile Control, this is the Captain. We have a change of target.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.84,1:47:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的坐标是034285219\N{\fnArial\fs30}New coordinates are 034285219.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.36,1:47:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹控制室 我是船长 目标有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile Control, Captain. We have a new target.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.68,1:49:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家回到潜艇里去 传话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody back on board the submarine! Pass it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.95,1:49:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.16,1:49:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,清除航线上的障碍 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foster, get those lines cleared! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.43,1:49:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaver, throw those guys a line!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.17,1:49:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把前后的防护板清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those block fenders cleared! Fore and aft!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.97,1:49:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把潜艇调整至下潜的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the submarine at diving stations!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.82,1:49:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶舱呼叫指挥部 反应堆只剩下一半的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, Maneuvering. Reactor at half-power state.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.52,1:49:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以接受电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to check telegraphs.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.02,1:49:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员马上就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel, take up positions fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.19,1:49:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫劳勃操作回转仪 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get Roberts in the gyro unit. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.36,1:49:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.30,1:49:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备恢复正常灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by to revert to normal lighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.47,1:49:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快把舱门关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sailor. Get that hatch shut quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.31,1:50:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指挥部呼叫鱼雷室 - 鱼雷室收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Torpedo Room, Control. - Torpedo Room.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.98,1:50:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把46号鱼雷装上一号管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load tube one with mark 46 torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.69,1:50:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一号管道的外层出口打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open outer door on tube one.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.33,1:50:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,回转仪角度为零度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Select zero gyro angle.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.06,1:50:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,外层出口已经打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outer door on tube one open.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.00,1:50:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准目标 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Match bearings and shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.57,1:50:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备 - 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Set. - Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.57,1:50:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼雷已经发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torpedo running.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.73,1:50:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在船体中部装舵 在前头三分二的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rudder amidships. Ahead two-thirds.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.24,1:51:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,向左移7度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left seven degrees rudder.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.10,1:52:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为有多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far would you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.84,1:52:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大概是一万码 - 指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About 10, 000 yards, sir. - Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.45,1:52:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.62,1:53:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到国防部的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got this signal from the Pentagon.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.96,1:53:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全理事会发出指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}On instructions from the Security Council:
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.29,1:53:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「从速把阿特兰蒂斯毁灭」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Destroy Atlantis fast."
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.46,1:53:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从速是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does "fast" mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.96,1:53:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟后进入作战状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battle stations five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.30,1:53:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射鱼雷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With torpedoes?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.47,1:53:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.30,1:53:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是安雅还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has Anya on there.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.64,1:53:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很抱歉 - 我要去救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. I'm sorry. - I have to get her off.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.14,1:53:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如何？- 可以把Q送来的装备给我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - Can I have the equipment Q sent?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.31,1:53:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.32,1:53:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上把邦德中校的包裹送过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barton. That package for Commander Bond, bring it in quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.49,1:53:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我一小时 - 那是最高指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need an hour. - That comes from the top!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.96,1:53:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.46,1:53:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把我交给军事法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get me court-martialed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.00,1:53:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.67,1:53:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.51,1:53:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.66,1:54:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 我正在恭候你大驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mr. Bond. I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.33,1:54:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别动 会有升降机下来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are. I'll send the elevator down for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.65,1:55:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.29,1:55:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想我掉下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did want me to drop in.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.47,1:55:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安雅在哪？- 喔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Anya? - Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.41,1:55:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国特工爱上俄国特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}A British agent in love with a Russian agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.65,1:55:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,想建立缓和关系吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detente, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.82,1:55:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.66,1:56:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你已经没有太多时间了 - 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your time is running out. - Yours too, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.17,1:56:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你想像中的还要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And faster than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.18,1:56:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经射了一箭 现在到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot your bolt. Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.57,1:56:45.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（逃生舱）
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.24,1:58:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that grab you?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.49,1:59:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经超过了五分钟 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're five minutes overdue, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.17,1:59:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯特龙伯格在哪 - 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stromberg? - Dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.34,1:59:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,若还不快逃命 我们也会没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are we unless we get out of here fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.41,1:59:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准目标 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Match bearings and shoot.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.84,2:01:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我低估了斯特龙伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I misjudged Stromberg.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.01,2:01:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,会欣赏52年的香槟的人都不会是大坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any man who drinks Dom Perignon '52 can't be all bad.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.95,2:01:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务已经完成 指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mission is over, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.47,2:02:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我国的死囚可以有最后的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my country, the condemned man is usually allowed a final request.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.61,2:02:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.65,2:02:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把还些湿衣服脱下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of these wet things.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.67,2:02:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们的上司会怎么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, James, what would our superiors say?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.48,2:02:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.79,2:03:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船尾的闸门放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower the stern gate.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.79,2:03:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会患上减压病吗？- 很快就会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there danger of the bends? - We'll soon find out.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.12,2:03:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德 - 3X\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 007. - XXX.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.02,2:03:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 你在干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.49,2:03:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了国家而做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping the British end up, sir.
